<div class="conan-tha_journal">
  {{#unless languageisfr}}
    <h1 style="margin-top: -6px">System guide</h1>
    <p class="intro_chap">
      Welcome to the
      <em><strong>Conan : The Hyborean age</strong></em>
      <strong>official</strong>
      system for Foundry VTT.</p>
    <p>This system has been designed and coded by Khaali, and permitted by the editing company <strong>Monolith Board Games</strong>.</p>
    <h2>Characters sheets</h2>
    <p>There are two types of actors : Players and NPC.</p><p>All character sheets have 2 tabs: the main one for attributes and skills, and another one for notes and background.</p>
    <p>All sheets must be unlocked by clicking on <i class="fas fa-lock"></i> before modification.</p>
    <h3>Players</h3>
    <p><em>Skills</em>,
      <em>Weapons</em>,
      <em>Armors</em>
      and
      <em>Spells</em>
      items types can be dragged-and-dropped on players sheets. Items can be edited or deleted by right-clicking on them.</p>
    <p>Rolls can be initiated by right-clicking on an attribute or a Weapon.</p>
    <h3>NPCs</h3>
    <p>A NPC can either be a <em>Minion</em> or an <em>Antagonist</em>. Minons have a Threshold, Antagonist have Hit Points.</p>
    <p>Only
      <em>NPC abilities</em>,
      <em>Weapons</em>, and
      <em>Spells</em>
      items types can be dragged-and-dropped on NPCs sheets. Items can be edited or deleted by right-clicking on them.</p>
    <h3>Check and attack Rolls</h3>
    <p>Rolls can be initiated from a character sheet by right-clicking on a stat or a Weapon.</p>
    <p>A dialog window opens and you can change the stat, add a modifier or a difficulty.</p>
    <h3>Options</h3>
    <p>The <strong>Advanced rules</strong> option adds icons on the players sheet that can be used to choose the fighting style.</p>
  {{/unless}}
</div>